🔍 Observability
Concept	One-line answer
Logs	Tell you what happened.
Metrics	Tell you how much, how often, and how fast.
Traces	Show where a particular request spent its time.
Latency	Measures how long a request takes.
Traffic	Measures how much workload is arriving.
Error Rate	Measures how many requests are failing.
Saturation	Shows how close a resource is to its capacity.
Alerting	Automatically notifies engineers when important conditions cross thresholds.

